VioletCity_Interior2_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "EARL, I am!\p"
	.string "Wonderful are POKéMON, yes!\p"
	.string "Teach you I will to be a better\n"
	.string "trainer!\p"
	.string "What you want to know? Want to be\n"
	.string "a winner is you?$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "So, you want to know how to raise\n"
	.string "POKéMON well?$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_FatMan_3::
	.string "Oh! Smart student you are! Nothing\n"
	.string "more do I teach!\p"
	.string "Good to POKéMON you must be!$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_FatMan_4::
	.string "Good! Teach you, I will!\p"
	.string "In battle, POKéMON top on list jump\n"
	.string "out first!\p"
	.string "Change order in list, make battle\n"
	.string "easy, maybe!\p"
	.string "More from me you want to hear?$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_FatMan_5::
	.string "Fine! Teach you, I will!\p"
	.string "If POKéMON come out in battle even\n"
	.string "briefly, some EXP.points it gets.\p"
	.string "At top of list put weak POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Switch in battle quick!\p"
	.string "This way, weak POKéMON strong\n"
	.string "become!$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Youngster::
	.string "Á’m taking notes of the teacher’s\n"
	.string "lecture.\p"
	.string "I’d better copy the stuff on the\n"
	.string "blackboard too. $"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Boy::
	.string "A POKéMON holding a BERRY will heal\n"
	.string "itself in battle.\p"
	.string "Many other items can be held by\n"
	.string "POKéMON…\p"
	.string "It sure is tough taking notes…$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_GbaKid::
	.string "I traded my best POKéMON to the\n"
	.string "guy beside me.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_GbaKid2::
	.string "Huh? The POKéMON I just got is\n"
	.string "holding something!$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "It’s this kid’s notebook…\p"
	.string "Catch POKéMON using POKéBALLS.\p"
	.string "Up to six can be in your party.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "Keep reading?$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_3::
	.string "Before throwing a POKéBALL, weaken\n"
	.string "the target first.\p"
	.string "A poisoned or burned POKéMON is\n"
	.string "easier to catch.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_4::
	.string "Some moves may cause confusion.\p"
	.string "Confusion may make a POKéMON\n"
	.string "attack itself.\p"
	.string "Leaving battle clears up any\n"
	.string "confusion.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_5::
	.string "People who catch and use POKéMON\n"
	.string "in battle are POKéMON trainers.\p"
	.string "They are expected to visit POKéMON\n"
	.string "GYMS and defeat other trainers.\p"
	.string "The next page is… Blank!$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign1_6::
	.string "Boy: E-he-he…\p"
	.string "I haven’t written anymore…$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_1::
	.string "The blackboard describes POKéMON\n"
	.string "status changes in battle.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_2::
	.string "Which topic do you want to read?$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_3::
	.string "If asleep, your POKéMON can’t make\n"
	.string "a move.\p"
	.string "A sleeping POKéMON doesn’t wake up\n"
	.string "after battle.\p"
	.string "Wake it up with an AWAKENING.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_4::
	.string "If poisoned, a POKéMON steadily\n"
	.string "loses HP.\p"
	.string "Poison lingers after the battle, and\n"
	.string "HP is lost as you walk.\p"
	.string "To cure it, use an ANTIDOTE.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_5::
	.string "Paralysis reduces SPEED and may\n"
	.string "prevent the POKéMON from moving.\p"
	.string "Paralysis remains after battles.\n"
	.string "Use PARLYZ HEAL for treatment.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_6::
	.string "A burn steadily consumes HP.\n"
	.string "It also reduces attack power.\p"
	.string "A burn lingers after battle.\p"
	.string "Use a BURN HEAL as the cure.$"

VioletCity_Interior2_Text_Sign2_7::
	.string "If your POKéMON is frozen, it can’t\n"
	.string "do a thing.\p"
	.string "It remains frozen after battle.\p"
	.string "Thaw it out with an ICE HEAL.$"
